  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Flergivarfond f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra ett mer koordinerat och harmoniserat st&#xf6;d till civila samh&#xe4;llet i Nicaragua. Syfte att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra dialogen mellan staten och civila samh&#xe4;llet genom att st&#xe4;rka civila samhllets kapacitet. Oxfam, storbrittanien administrerar fonden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multidonor Fund established to promote a more coordinated and harmonised support to Nicaraguan civil society. The aim is to contribute to enhancing the dialogue between the State and civil societ by strengthening the capacities of the civil society  organizations. Oxfam GB is on charge of administration of the fund.</narrative>
